@startuml candidate-public-screen-flow
title RMS - Screen Flow: Public User and Candidate

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor<<Screen>> #E3F2FD
  BackgroundColor<<Popup>> #FFF3CD
  BackgroundColor<<External>> #E8EAF6
  BackgroundColor<<Error>> #FDE2E1
  BorderColor #1E3A5F
  FontColor #172033
}

state "Public landing + published jobs\n/" as Landing <<Screen>>
state "Job details\nreusable modal" as JobDetail <<Popup>>
state "Sign up\n/signup" as Register <<Screen>>
state "Registration OTP\nsame /signup screen" as SignupOtp <<Popup>>
state "Standalone email verification\n/verify-email" as VerifyEmail <<Screen>>
state "Sign in\n/login" as Login <<Screen>>
state "Forgot password\n/forgot-password" as ForgotPassword <<Screen>>
state "Reset password\n/reset-password?email&token" as ResetPassword <<Screen>>
state "Google / Supabase identity provider" as GoogleAuth <<External>>
state "Unauthorized\n/unauthorized" as Unauthorized <<Error>>

state "Candidate dashboard\n/candidate" as Dashboard <<Screen>>
state "My profile\n/candidate/profile" as Profile <<Screen>>
state "Avatar crop / frame editor\nmodal on Profile" as AvatarEditor <<Popup>>
state "Upload & edit CV\n/candidate/upload-cv" as UploadCv <<Screen>>
state "Upload / parsing progress\npopup" as CvProgress <<Popup>>
state "CV parsed successfully\nmodal" as CvSuccess <<Popup>>
state "Delete CV confirmation\nmodal" as CvDelete <<Popup>>
state "CV required before applying\nmodal" as CvRequired <<Popup>>
state "Inbox alerts\n/candidate/notifications" as Notifications <<Screen>>
state "Interview details + response form\n/candidate/interviews?id=:scheduleId" as Interviews <<Screen>>
state "My offers\n/candidate/offers" as Offers <<Screen>>
state "Offer details + response form\n/candidate/offer/:offerId" as OfferDetail <<Screen>>

[*] --> Landing

Landing --> JobDetail : View published job\n[GET /api/v1/public/job-postings?status=PUBLISHED&visibility=PUBLIC]
JobDetail --> Landing : Close modal
JobDetail --> Login : Sign in to apply (public action)
Landing --> Login : Sign In
Landing --> Register : Get Started / Sign up

Register --> SignupOtp : Email/password registration succeeds\n[POST /api/v1/auth/register]
SignupOtp --> SignupOtp : Verify or resend code\n[POST /api/v1/auth/verify-register]\n[POST /api/v1/auth/resend-register-otp]
SignupOtp --> Dashboard : Go to Dashboard\n[verified role = CANDIDATE]
Register --> GoogleAuth : Continue with Google
Login --> GoogleAuth : Continue with Google
GoogleAuth --> Dashboard : Existing Candidate account\n[POST /api/v1/auth/supabase-login]
GoogleAuth --> Register : New Google account; complete role/profile\n[/auth/supabase-login returns account-not-registered]
Register --> Dashboard : Finish Google-backed Candidate registration\n[POST /api/v1/auth/supabase-register]

Register ..> VerifyEmail : Standalone route also exists;\ncurrent SignUp keeps OTP inline
VerifyEmail --> Login : Verification completed

Login --> Dashboard : Credentials accepted (CANDIDATE)\n[POST /api/v1/auth/login]
Login --> ForgotPassword : Forgot password?
ForgotPassword --> ForgotPassword : Send reset email; show success state\n[POST /api/v1/auth/forgot-password]
ForgotPassword --> ResetPassword : Open link received by email
ResetPassword --> Login : Reset succeeds; choose Back to sign in\n[POST /api/v1/auth/reset-password]
Login --> Unauthorized : Direct access to a route for another role

Dashboard --> JobDetail : View job details
JobDetail --> JobDetail : Apply with an uploaded CV\n[POST /api/v1/applications]
Dashboard --> Dashboard : Apply from job card\n[POST /api/v1/applications]
Dashboard --> CvRequired : Apply without an uploaded CV
JobDetail --> CvRequired : Apply without an uploaded CV
CvRequired --> UploadCv : Upload CV
CvRequired --> Dashboard : Cancel

Dashboard --> Profile : Sidebar: My Profile
Profile --> Profile : Save personal/contact data\n[PATCH /api/v1/candidate-profiles/me]
Profile --> AvatarEditor : Add / replace avatar or edit frame
AvatarEditor --> Profile : Save or delete avatar\n[POST|DELETE /api/v1/candidate-profiles/me/avatar]\n[PATCH /api/v1/candidate-profiles/me]

Dashboard --> UploadCv : Sidebar: Upload CV
UploadCv --> CvProgress : Upload or replace file\n[POST /api/v1/candidate/cvs]\n[PATCH /api/v1/candidate/cvs/:id/file]
CvProgress --> CvProgress : Poll parsing status\n[GET /api/v1/candidate/cvs]
CvProgress --> CvSuccess : Parsing becomes Ready
CvProgress --> UploadCv : Parsing fails / close progress
CvSuccess --> UploadCv : Review parsed result
UploadCv --> CvDelete : Delete document
CvDelete --> UploadCv : Confirm or cancel\n[DELETE /api/v1/candidate/cvs/:id]
UploadCv --> UploadCv : Edit structured resume and save profile\n[PATCH /api/v1/candidate-profiles/me]

Dashboard --> Notifications : Sidebar: Inbox Alerts\n[GET /api/v1/notifications]
Notifications --> Notifications : Mark read/unread or archive\n[PATCH /api/v1/notifications/:id/read|unread]\n[DELETE /api/v1/notifications/:id]
Notifications --> OfferDetail : Open OfferLetter notification
Notifications --> Interviews : Open InterviewSchedule notification
Notifications --> Notifications : Confirm attendance from alert\n[POST /api/v1/interviews/schedules/:id/confirm]

Dashboard --> Interviews : Sidebar: Interview Details
Interviews --> Interviews : Confirm attendance\n[POST /api/v1/interviews/schedules/:id/confirm]
Interviews --> Interviews : Request reschedule\n[PATCH /api/v1/interviews/schedules/:id/candidate-reschedule]
Interviews --> Interviews : Cancel with reason\n[PATCH /api/v1/interviews/schedules/:id/candidate-cancel]

Dashboard --> Offers : Sidebar: My Offers\n[GET /api/v1/offers/me]
Offers --> OfferDetail : Open offer\n[GET /api/v1/offers/:offerId]
OfferDetail --> OfferDetail : Accept or decline with optional note\n[POST /api/v1/offers/:offerId/respond]
OfferDetail --> Offers : Back to offers

Dashboard --> Login : Sign out\n[POST /api/v1/auth/logout]

note bottom of Login
  Login redirects every successful account to its role home.
  This diagram follows the CANDIDATE branch.
  /dashboard also redirects a Candidate session to /candidate.
end note

note bottom of Unauthorized
  ProtectedRoute sends an unauthenticated visitor to /login
  and a signed-in user with the wrong role to /unauthorized.
end note

@enduml
